{"sha": "8ef92a886e1f6b3004c876e15a8f11281d660a03ceb06c9c8b14f485c3a6b3ce", "body": ["\\begin{example}[极坐标；再谈高斯积分]", "\\label{ex:b3:product:polar}", "$\\Phi(r, \\theta) = (r\\cos\\theta, r\\sin\\theta)$ 是 $\\mathcal", "C^1$ 类微分同胚，从 $\\intoo0{+\\infty}\\times\\intoo0{2\\pi}$", "满射至 $\\R^2$ 去掉一条半直线（零测集）后的集合，且 $\\det D\\Phi =", "r$：\\index{极坐标}", "\\[", "\\int_{\\R^2}f(x, y)\\,\\dd x\\,\\dd y", "= \\int_0^{2\\pi}\\!\\!\\int_0^{+\\infty}", "f(r\\cos\\theta, r\\sin\\theta)\\,r\\,\\dd r\\,\\dd\\theta .", "\\]", "设 $f = \\eu^{-x^2-y^2}$，由托内利定理及上式可得", "\\[", "G^2 = \\Bigl(\\int_\\R \\eu^{-x^2}\\dd x\\Bigr)^2", "= \\int_{\\R^2}\\eu^{-x^2-y^2}", "= 2\\pi\\int_0^\\infty r\\eu^{-r^2}\\dd r = \\pi:", "\\]", "这是 $G = \\sqrt\\pi$ 的经典两行证明，现在已", "完全严格（可与", "\\cref{pb:b3:lebesgue:1} 中的参数证明比较）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[单位球的体积]", "\\label{thm:b3:product:ballvolume}", "设 $v_d = \\lambda_d(B(0,1))$ 为 $\\R^d$ 中单位球的体积，则\\index{单位球的", "体积}", "\\[", "v_d = \\frac{\\pi^{d/2}}{\\Gamma\\bigl(\\frac d2 + 1\\bigr)} :", "\\qquad", "v_1 = 2,\\quad v_2 = \\pi,\\quad v_3 = \\tfrac{4\\pi}3,\\quad", "v_4 = \\tfrac{\\pi^2}2,\\ \\dots", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "以两种方式计算 $I = \\int_{\\R^d}\\eu^{-\\norm x_2^2}\\dd\\lambda_d$。", "由托内利定理，它分解为 $I = G^d = \\pi^{d/2}$。利用", "层饼公式（\\cref{prop:b3:product:layercake}），取 $f = \\eu^{-", "\\norm x^2}$，其水平集为球：$\\{f > t\\} =", "B\\bigl(0, \\sqrt{-\\ln t}\\bigr)$ 对 $0 < t < 1$，其测度为", "$v_d(-\\ln t)^{d/2}$（以 $\\rho$ 作伸缩时 $\\lambda_d$ 乘以", "$\\rho^d$：见\\cref{thm:b3:product:linearchange}），于是", "\\[", "I = \\int_0^1 v_d\\,(-\\ln t)^{d/2}\\,\\dd t", "\\overset{t = \\eu^{-s}}{=}", "v_d\\int_0^\\infty s^{d/2}\\eu^{-s}\\,\\dd s", "= v_d\\,\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac d2 + 1\\Bigr).", "\\]", "两式相等。（取值：$\\Gamma(\\frac32) = \\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2$，", "$\\Gamma(2) = 1$ 等）。注意 $v_d \\to 0$（$d \\to \\infty$ 时） ---", "周末问题借助斯特林公式给出其收敛速度。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:product:1}", "设 $\\mu$ 为 $(\\intcc01, \\mathcal", "B(\\intcc01))$ 上的计数测度（非 $\\sigma$-有限），$\\lambda$ 为勒贝格", "测度，记 $\\Delta = \\{(x,x)\\}$ 为 $\\intcc01^2$ 中的", "对角线。证明 $\\Delta$ 可测，并计算 $\\mathbf 1_\\Delta$ 分别关于", "$\\lambda$ 与 $\\mu$ 的两个累次积分，二者不相等。", "\\cref{thm:b3:product:tonelli} 的哪一条", "假设不成立？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:product:2}", "证明交换积分次序的合理性，并重新推导狄利克雷积分：对", "$A > 0$，", "\\[", "\\int_0^A\\frac{\\sin x}x\\,\\dd x", "= \\int_0^A\\!\\!\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\eu^{-xy}\\sin x\\,\\dd y\\,\\dd x", "= \\int_0^{+\\infty}\\!\\!\\int_0^A \\eu^{-xy}\\sin x\\,\\dd x\\,\\dd y,", "\\]", "求内层积分的闭形式，并令 $A \\to", "+\\infty$（对 $y$ 积分作控制），得到", "$\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\sin x}x\\dd x = \\frac\\pi2$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:product:3}", "(a) 证明：若 $f \\geq 0$ 可测且 $\\mu$ 有限，则", "$\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\mu(\\{f \\geq n\\}) \\leq \\int f\\,\\dd\\mu \\leq", "\\mu(X) + \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\mu(\\{f\\geq n\\})$：可积性即", "尾测度的可和性。", "(b) 由此推得 $f \\in L^1(\\mu)$（$\\mu$ 有限）当且仅当", "$\\sum_n\\mu(\\abs f \\geq n) < \\infty$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:product:4}", "设 $f(x, y) = \\dfrac{x^2 - y^2}{(x^2 + y^2)^2}$ 在", "$\\intoo01^2$ 上，证明", "\\[", "\\int_0^1\\!\\!\\int_0^1 f\\,\\dd y\\,\\dd x = \\frac\\pi4,", "\\qquad", "\\int_0^1\\!\\!\\int_0^1 f\\,\\dd x\\,\\dd y = -\\frac\\pi4", "\\]", "\\emph{（注意 $f = \\partial_y\\bigl(\\frac{y}{x^2+y^2}\\bigr)$）}，", "并直接验证 $\\int\\!\\int\\abs f = +\\infty$：富比尼", "的可积性假设绝非装饰。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b3:product:5}", "(a) 显式计算 $\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc01} * \\mathbf 1_{\\intcc01}$", "（帐篷函数），并给出 $(\\mathbf 1 * \\mathbf 1 *", "\\mathbf 1)$ 的一般形状。", "(b) 证明 $\\operatorname{supp}(f * g) \\subseteq", "\\overline{\\operatorname{supp}f + \\operatorname{supp}g}$。", "(c) 证明：若 $f \\in L^1$，$g$ 有界且连续，", "则 $f * g$ 连续。\\emph{（由控制收敛定理，借助", "有界函数 $g$ 的平移连续性。）}", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}